		(property "Description" "TI TPS63802 2-A buck-boost converter, VIN 1.3-5.5V (start-up > 1.8V), VOUT 1.8-5.2V adjustable, VFB = 500 mV, 10-pin VSON-HR (DLA0010A) 3.0x2.0mm 0.5mm pitch, orderable TPS63802DLAR. Hand-authored from TI SLVSEU9D (Nov 2018, rev. Jan 2021): Table 7-1 Pin Functions 1=EN, 2=MODE, 3=AGND, 4=FB, 5=PG (open drain), 6=VOUT, 7=L2, 8=GND, 9=L1, 10=VIN (checked in pdftotext -raw and -layout). Section 8.1 abs max 6V on VIN/L1/L2/EN/MODE/VOUT/FB/PG. EN and MODE must not float."
